.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Exposes min and max functions for 3 to 4 vector parameters\&.
.PP
Include <\fBglm/ext/vector_common\&.hpp\fP> to use the features of this extension\&.
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
core_common 
.PP
\fBGLM_EXT_scalar_common\fP
.RE
.PP

